2914  07BB              ; 'GET STRING FROM KEYBOARD'
2915  07BB              ; ==========================
2916  07BB              ; This function reads a string from the keyboard into the input buffer. String
2917  07BB              ; is terminated with ASCII CR. Some minimal editing is supported ("LEFT" key
